authored_scope:
Random scenes sample the following:
- grid size: 18..30 per side by default, 14..30 explicitly; sizes below 30 are synthetic extensions;
- background and rectangle colours;
- a compact rectangle (7..13 per side) or a full-width band (5..8 rows);
- rectangle position;
- 2-4 hole classes from a 19-shape hole-free polyomino library;
- hole symmetry (none, left-right, up-down, both);
- winner counts of 1-4 per class;
- strictly-fewer competing colours;
- 0-2 decoy shape classes;
- random piece orientations.

The rectangle-colour fallback (a hole with no matching piece) is supported only with allow_unmatched=True. It is off by default because the real demonstrations always contain a match.

Not supported:
- non-rectangular large objects;
- pieces inside the rectangle's box;
- touching pieces or holes;
- tied majorities.
